  "description": "MIHJOF crystallizes in the orthorhombic crystal system with space group P b c n. Reported CIF formula moiety: C76 H40 F36 Gd4 N8 O20. From the CIF bond table, Gd1 (Gd) has 7 O neighbors; Gd2 (Gd) has 7 O neighbors; Gd3 (Gd) has 7 O neighbors; Gd4 (Gd) has 7 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 6 pairs, 1 components; largest component is a network with cycles with three-dimensional metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.855-3.968 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 104.92-110.38°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula C76H40N8O20F36Gd4.",
